%\end{theorem}
%
%\begin{proof} Let $H = (V,E)$ be a $d$-flat hypergraph, and let $H' = (V,E')$ be its intersection-closure. We define a mapping $F : [V]^{\leq d} \rightarrow E'$ such that for each $S \in [V]^{\leq d}$, we have $F(S) = M_{H'}(S)$.
