+## Use
+
+```python
+from gen_2311_00466 import DIFFICULTY, make_instance, parse_answer, render, verify
+
+inst = make_instance(seed=42, **DIFFICULTY["medium"])
+prompt = render(inst)
+candidate = parse_answer(model_reply)
